cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Structural isomer generator and exercises, powered by Surge'
abstract: 'A web service and application wrapping the Surge chemical graph generator (https://github.com/StructureGenerator/surge). It enumerates every constitutional isomer of a molecular formula through a REST API, and turns that enumeration into an exercise: the student draws the isomers and the service grades them.'
repository-artifact: https://surge.cheminfo.org
repository-code: https://github.com/cheminfo/surge
